  "explanation": "No tool defines sell-through, so I used units sold in August divided by (opening stock at 1 Aug plus units received in August). NW014 sold 53,782 base units. Opening stock was 43,891 (received before August 280,220, less sold 232,489, less transfers out 3,840), and 48,992 units were received in August. That gives 53,782 / 92,883 \u2248 57.9%. I ignored returns and August transfers out."
